# Partition Game Testing Plan

1. [ ] Open http://localhost:8092/
2. [ ] Click 'Start Game' button.
3. [ ] Click canvas to build a wall.
4. [ ] Right-click canvas to change orientation.
5. [ ] Click canvas again to build another wall.
6. [ ] Verify ball movement, wall completion, and life logic.
7. [ ] Final assessment of game functionality.
